      "writtenOn": "2021-10-18T17:37:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thing is alloc_contig_range API is just one time operation but caller should keep retrying at the failure case. Let\u0027s think about what happens if the migration fails. Those failed page will go to LRU pagevec again so alloc_contig_range needs other LRU draining which is expensive. If we move the draining logic of the clients of alloc_contig_range, we effectively reduces the LRU drain cost as well as increasing contiguous memory allocation potentially.",
      "parentUuid": "b1493886_69095728",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 470,
